From 0fdf38de2884246e7f0107d5bca152aef669cc3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:45:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] soc: apple: clpc: Describe pmp_agent

W=1 builds warn that pmp_agent is missing from the kernel-doc comment of
struct apple_clpc_hw. Describe it.

Assisted-by: LLM Claude
Signed-off-by: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c b/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c
index 65495cac1e0e..fc29cdcd45f8 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c
@@ -76,6 +76,7 @@ enum apple_clpc_rail {
  *	counts as streaming, see apple_clpc_gpu_streaming(); 0 counts it at once
  * @pmp_backoff: release that GPU floor while the PMP, voter agent
  *	@pmp_agent, limits the DCS, see apple_clpc_gpu_limited()
+ * @pmp_agent: with @pmp_backoff, the PMP's voter agent
  * @gpu_dense: submissions per sampling period that make light GPU work
  *	dense, see apple_clpc_gpu_dense(); 0 for none
  * @gpu_input: the GPU driver reports its work in flight through
